,"6"]}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9XHtJBb570mSvc2","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID2428","SecondaryAttribute":"Flooding Valleys Valleys in the Whitgus mountains are protected from floods by dams which are how...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Flooding Valleys<\/b><br><br>\n\n\nValleys in the Whitgus mountains are protected from floods by dams which are however badly maintained. One day during the spring snow melt, the dam protecting Leefside Valley collapses. If nothing is done, Leefside Valley will be flooded, and all inhabitants will drown.\n<br> <br>\nThe operations engineer can open floodgates in another dam, which would trigger a massive mudslide engulfing Llyne Valley and kill all the people there.\n<br> <br>\nYou are the operations engineer. If you decide to open the flood gates, you would save 200 people in Leefside Valley, but kill 10 people in Llyne Valley <b>who would be trapped in mud for hours before finally and painfully dying by being crushed and finally of asphyxiation.<\/b>\n<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.valleysFlooding.vivid.counterbalancing_group.2.n_saved.200.n_total.210.n_victims.10.ratio_saved_victims.20","QuestionID":"QID2428","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","QuestionDescription":"Flooding Valleys Valleys in the Whitgus mountains are protected from floods by dams which are how...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<p style=\"min-width:350px;\"> How horrific would the death of the people in Leefside Valley be for each of the affected persons? <br><\/p>"},"2":{"Display":"<p style=\"min-width:350px;\"> How horrific would the death of the people in Llyne Valley be for each of the affected persons? <br><\/p>"},"3":{"Display":"<p style=\"min-width:350px;\"> How acceptable is it to open the floodgates and to kill 10 people in Llyne Valley to save the 200 people in Leafside Valley? <br><\/p>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"RecodeValues":{"1":"1",