ning what people think about difficult situations and how to act in these situations. We would like to learn from your personal thoughts.<\/div>\n\n<p><o:p><\/o:p><\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q103","QuestionID":"QID103"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_9XHtJBb570mSvc2","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1881","SecondaryAttribute":"Toxic factory A fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<b>Toxic factory<\/b><br><br>\n\n\nA fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills within seconds even in minimal doses. If released, everybody in the immediately surrounding area will be killed, though the factory workers themselves will be fine due to their respiratory equipment.\n<br> <br>\nThe firefighters can prevent the release of heptahopretyde by using heavy lift helicopters to drop a containment tent over the building that concentrates and then purifies the gases. This will save 400 people in the surrounding area. However, this will overwhelm the respiratory equipment of 40 workers and kill them due to heptahopretyde exposure.\n<br><br>\n\n","DataExportTag":"scenario.toxicFactory.neutral.counterbalancing_group.1.n_saved.400.n_total.440.n_victims.40.ratio_saved_victims.10","QuestionID":"QID1881","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","QuestionDescription":"Toxic factory A fire in a chemical factory threatens to release heptahopretyde, a gas that kills...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<p style=\"min-width:350px;\"> How horrific would the death of the people in the surrounding area be for each of the affected persons? <br><\/p>"},"2":{"Display":"<p style=\"min-width:350px;\"> How horrific would the death of the workers be for each of the affected persons?<br><\/p>"},"3":{"Display":"<p style=\"min-width:350px;\"> How acceptable is it to kill the 40 factory workers to save 400 people in the surrounding area? <br><\/p>"}},"ChoiceOrder":[